          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1F2A30]">What Is Ultrasonic Teeth Scaling?</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
            Even with regular daily brushing, soft food plaque mixes with minerals in saliva and hardens into tartar (calculus) behind the lower front teeth and along the gumline. A toothbrush cannot remove hardened tartar. Ultrasonic scaling uses gentle high-frequency vibrations and a fine mist of water to loosen and wash away tartar and surface stains without harming your tooth enamel.
          </p>
