          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-base text-slate-700 list-disc pl-5">
            <li>Hard yellow or brownish crust visible near the gumline or behind lower teeth.</li>
            <li>Bleeding gums when brushing or biting into crisp fruits.</li>
            <li>Persistent bad breath despite brushing twice daily.</li>
            <li>Tea, coffee, paan, or tobacco stains dulling your teeth.</li>
            <li>Over a year since your last preventive dental check-up.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

