              <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-600">Every ultrasonic tip and mirror is sterilised in sealed autoclave pouches and opened in front of you prior to cleaning.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ol class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-base text-slate-700 list-decimal pl-5">
            <li><strong>Gum &amp; Tartar Check:</strong> Dr. Shubham Gupta checks each tooth and gum pocket to locate tartar deposits.</li>
            <li><strong>Ultrasonic Scaling:</strong> A smooth ultrasonic tip glides gently along the teeth and gum edge with cool water spray to break up hardened deposits.</li>
            <li><strong>Polishing:</strong> Teeth are polished with a mild paste so surfaces feel smooth and resist fresh plaque attachment.</li>
            <li><strong>Oral Hygiene Guidance:</strong> Simple brushing and interdental tips tailored to your teeth and gums.</li>
          </ol>
